# Milestone 10 — Settings & Notifications Module Execution Log (TDD)

## Date: 2026-08-19
## Branch: `feature/m10-settings-notifications`

## Overview
Implemented the Settings screen for the Flutter `mobile_app`: saved-record
management (view/edit/delete routines) and notification preferences toggles
(exercise alerts, food alerts, daily intake reminders). Executed as a strict
Red → Green → Verify TDD cycle driven by the Gherkin contract in
`mobile_app/test/features/m10_settings.feature`.

---

## Architect deliverables (created first)
- `mobile_app/test/features/m10_settings.feature` — 10 Gherkin scenarios
  (open settings, view record, edit record, delete record, toggles off by
  default, enable each toggle, persistence across screen changes).
- `docs/milestone_10_plan.md` — technical plan (branch, data-layer analysis,
  new components, mocking strategy, TDD order, DoD).

